cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the FedPCD paper and the FedMultimodal benchmark."
title: "FedPCD: Prototype-Cross Distillation for Multimodal Federated Learning"
abstract: >-
  FedPCD is a multimodal federated learning method for client-level modality
  missingness. It combines global knowledge distillation, cross-modal
  projection recovery, and prototype-cross alignment without public or proxy
  data.
authors:
  - name: "The FedPCD Authors"
year: 2026
license: Apache-2.0
